{"v":4,"catch":"“FALCON”加入空中戰鬥！","desc":"《FIGHTING HAWK》是TAITO於1988年發行的一款射擊遊戲。\n玩家駕駛戰機“FALCON”，在平原、冰山、冰川、雪原和城市的場景中與敵人作戰，最終目標是擊落敵人最新的轟炸機：“DRAGON BAT”！\n建立強大的導彈儲備，然後將它們釋放到強大的敵人身上！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-05-06","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/89eb86ed052c8e5fa81a223ffbe84687044b5920219870d98d5b935221de5c97.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/416bf71f0b7c157e8e5fc50b6964af9b3228788c019c429d77b07cd4eb48771f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f082b01d57dabf6e7f0ec60641ae8c8486fb5de151680dba78e4362a4519c097.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8d1405d2c6ec76a6b722c75235b74463c7dcb18b78a6b33f33360e7147db9cfc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fbddfcf5753dacf62bb292e8a6cc82828a32f50fa013bf944918a9b7095b285c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/157e316ab1937386917bc37475dba8ef6234fdbd1b39a1518783b5cfc5a75767.jpg"],"titleId":"0100f980178d2000","dlc":[]}